If ${\mathcal{I}}({\mathfrak p}'') = L'$, then we set ${\mathfrak p}_{{\vartheta}} = {\mathfrak p}''$ and note that as ${\mathfrak p}'' \in \mathfrak{A}_{{\vartheta},N}$
\begin{equation}
